{"id":97600,"slug":"97600-vi-sao-khong-nen-dat-v-if-va-v-for-tren-cung-mot-the-viet-lai-the-nao-cho-dung","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Template","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Vì sao không nên đặt `v-if` và `v-for` trên cùng một thẻ? Viết lại thế nào cho đúng?","question_en":"Why should you avoid putting `v-if` and `v-for` on the same element? How do you rewrite it?","answer_vi":"Vì trong Vue 3, **`v-if` có độ ưu tiên cao hơn `v-for`** — điều kiện được đánh giá **trước**, nên nó **không nhìn thấy biến của vòng lặp**. Đoạn dưới ném lỗi vì `user` chưa tồn tại ở thời điểm `v-if` chạy:\n\n```vue\n<!-- sai: `user` chưa được định nghĩa -->\n<li v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\" :key=\"user.id\">\n  {{ user.name }}\n</li>\n```\n\nHai cách sửa:\n\n```vue\n<!-- 1. lọc bằng computed (nên dùng) -->\n<li v-for=\"user in activeUsers\" :key=\"user.id\">{{ user.name }}</li>\n\n<!-- 2. bọc bằng <template v-for> rồi để v-if bên trong -->\n<template v-for=\"user in users\" :key=\"user.id\">\n  <li v-if=\"user.isActive\">{{ user.name }}</li>\n</template>\n```\n\nCách 1 tốt hơn về hiệu năng: `computed` được cache, danh sách lọc chỉ tính lại khi `users` đổi, còn đặt `v-if` trong vòng lặp thì mỗi lần re-render đều duyệt toàn bộ phần tử. Lưu ý `:key` phải gắn vào phần tử thật sự lặp — với `<template v-for>` thì `:key` nằm trên `<template>`.","answer_en":"Because in Vue 3 **`v-if` has higher priority than `v-for`** — the condition is evaluated **first**, so it **cannot see the loop variable**. The snippet below throws because `user` does not exist yet when `v-if` runs:\n\n```vue\n<!-- wrong: `user` is not defined yet -->\n<li v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\" :key=\"user.id\">\n  {{ user.name }}\n</li>\n```\n\nTwo fixes:\n\n```vue\n<!-- 1. filter in a computed (preferred) -->\n<li v-for=\"user in activeUsers\" :key=\"user.id\">{{ user.name }}</li>\n\n<!-- 2. wrap with <template v-for> and move v-if inside -->\n<template v-for=\"user in users\" :key=\"user.id\">\n  <li v-if=\"user.isActive\">{{ user.name }}</li>\n</template>\n```\n\nOption 1 also performs better: the `computed` is cached and only recalculates when `users` changes, whereas a `v-if` inside the loop re-evaluates every item on each render. Note `:key` must sit on the element actually being repeated — with `<template v-for>` the key goes on the `<template>`.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Vì trong Vue 3, <strong><code>v-if</code> có độ ưu tiên cao hơn <code>v-for</code></strong> — điều kiện được đánh giá <strong>trước</strong>, nên nó <strong>không nhìn thấy biến của vòng lặp</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đoạn dưới ném lỗi vì <code>user</code> chưa tồn tại ở thời điểm <code>v-if</code> chạy:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- sai: `user` chưa được định nghĩa --&gt;\n&lt;li v-for=&quot;user in users&quot; v-if=&quot;user.isActive&quot; :key=&quot;user.id&quot;&gt;\n  {{ user.name }}\n&lt;/li&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- sai: `user` chưa được định nghĩa --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user in users&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-if</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.isActive&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  {{ user.name }}\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Hai cách sửa:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 1. lọc bằng computed (nên dùng) --&gt;\n&lt;li v-for=&quot;user in activeUsers&quot; :key=&quot;user.id&quot;&gt;{{ user.name }}&lt;/li&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 2. bọc bằng &lt;template v-for&gt; rồi để v-if bên trong --&gt;\n&lt;template v-for=&quot;user in users&quot; :key=&quot;user.id&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;li v-if=&quot;user.isActive&quot;&gt;{{ user.name }}&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 1. lọc bằng computed (nên dùng) --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user in activeUsers&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>{{ user.name }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 2. bọc bằng &lt;template v-for&gt; rồi để v-if bên trong --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user in users&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-if</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.isActive&quot;</span>&gt;</span>{{ user.name }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Cách 1 tốt hơn về hiệu năng: <code>computed</code> được cache, danh sách lọc chỉ tính lại khi <code>users</code> đổi, còn đặt <code>v-if</code> trong vòng lặp thì mỗi lần re-render đều duyệt toàn bộ phần tử.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Lưu ý <code>:key</code> phải gắn vào phần tử thật sự lặp — với <code>&lt;template v-for&gt;</code> thì <code>:key</code> nằm trên <code>&lt;template&gt;</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Because in Vue 3 <strong><code>v-if</code> has higher priority than <code>v-for</code></strong> — the condition is evaluated <strong>first</strong>, so it <strong>cannot see the loop variable</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The snippet below throws because <code>user</code> does not exist yet when <code>v-if</code> runs:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- wrong: `user` is not defined yet --&gt;\n&lt;li v-for=&quot;user in users&quot; v-if=&quot;user.isActive&quot; :key=&quot;user.id&quot;&gt;\n  {{ user.name }}\n&lt;/li&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- wrong: `user` is not defined yet --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user in users&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-if</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.isActive&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  {{ user.name }}\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Two fixes:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 1. filter in a computed (preferred) --&gt;\n&lt;li v-for=&quot;user in activeUsers&quot; :key=&quot;user.id&quot;&gt;{{ user.name }}&lt;/li&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 2. wrap with &lt;template v-for&gt; and move v-if inside --&gt;\n&lt;template v-for=&quot;user in users&quot; :key=&quot;user.id&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;li v-if=&quot;user.isActive&quot;&gt;{{ user.name }}&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 1. filter in a computed (preferred) --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user in activeUsers&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>{{ user.name }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 2. wrap with &lt;template v-for&gt; and move v-if inside --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user in users&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-if</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;user.isActive&quot;</span>&gt;</span>{{ user.name }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Option 1 also performs better: the <code>computed</code> is cached and only recalculates when <code>users</code> changes, whereas a <code>v-if</code> inside the loop re-evaluates every item on each render.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Note <code>:key</code> must sit on the element actually being repeated — with <code>&lt;template v-for&gt;</code> the key goes on the <code>&lt;template&gt;</code>.</p>","references":[{"label":"Vue Style Guide — Essential rules (avoid v-if with v-for)","url":"https://vuejs.org/style-guide/rules-essential.html"},{"label":"Vue Guide — List rendering","url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show, v-for, v-model, v-bind, v-on?"},{"url":"/q/3206-v-if-vs-v-show-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"v-if vs v-show — khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/3207-tai-sao-key-trong-v-for-quan-trong","title":"Tại sao `:key` trong `v-for` quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/3208-v-model-hoat-dong-the-nao-custom-v-model","title":"v-model hoạt động thế nào? Custom v-model?"}]}